This is an updated list of known sites archiving the entire NetHack 3.1.0 source
tree, in addition to the regular comp.sources.games archive sites.

	-------------------

	### USA ###

(Illinois)	uxc.cso.uiuc.edu	pub/nethack-3.1.0.tar.Z
(Kentucky)	s.ecc.engr.uky.edu	/pub/uploads/nethack3.1/*
	* The archive on uky is organized by system architecture as a set of split
	tar files, so you don't have to get the architecture specific files for
	systems you don't want or need. This is also a temorary archive site for
	the initial flood of requests and will be deleting the nethack stuff
	around 2 Apr.
(Oregon)	ftp.world.net		~ftp/pub/games/nethack31.tar.Z
(Oregon) 	saab.cna.tek.com	/usr1/ftp/games-archive/nethack31.tar.Z
	* NOTE: For non-Tektronix hosts, there is uucp access only. Send email
	if you need specifics (phone number, login, etc.) or consult the
	periodic posting of the standard list of archivers of c.s.g.
(Virginia)	ftp.uu.net		~ftp/usenet/comp.sources.games/nethack31.tar.Z

	### AUSTRALIA ###

(Australia)	brolga.cc.uq.oz.au	~ftp/pub/games/nethack31.tar.Z
(Australia)	brolga.cc.uq.oz.au	~ftp/pub/games/nethack31.zoo
	* Please limit your access to the above site to between 6pm and 8am.
	* The .zoo file is about 20% smaller than the .tar.Z file (<2M).
(Australia)	ftp.uts.edu.au	/usr/ftp/pub/NH3.1/
	* Saved in GNU Zip format. 48K link. Also has Linux binaries.

	### EUROPE ###

(France)	ftp.inria.fr		~ftp/games/nethack31.tar.Z
	* Normal location, time of day and ftp etiquette rules apply.
(France)	irisa.irisa.fr		~ftp/pub/games/nethack31.tar.Z
(Germany) 	ftp.uni-erlangen.de	/pub/games/nethack31.tar.Z
(Germany)	ftp.uni-kl.de		/pub/unix/games/nethack31.tar.Z
(The Netherlands)	dnpap.et.tudelft.nl	/pub/Unix/Games/nethack31.tar.Z
(Sweden)	ftp.luth.se		pub/misc/nethack/


* In about a week, linc.cis.upenn.edu will update their archives with split
tar files of 3.1 like the uky archive and binaries for selected architectures.

As always, the regular comp.sources.games archive sites will have copies
of what is posted (i.e. the 108 individual shar files).


